[[1,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">Op. 7055B54 PROTECTION/GUARD UNDER ENGINE - R.R.</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing nuts and bolts (1a) and remove the bracket connecting the manual gearbox to the engine (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002204.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the bracket connecting the gearbox to the engine and tighten the fixing nuts and bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>GEARBOX/ENGINE COUPLING BRACKET</p></td><td><p>M12 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Bracket to gearbox) 8</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">Op. 7055B54 PROTECTION/GUARD UNDER ENGINE - R.R.</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[8,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002205.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002206.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002207.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002208.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>1. Unscrew bolt (1a), screws (1b) and (1c) and remove the bell housing bracket (1d).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/199002281.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Place the bell housing bracket in its housing and secure it tightening the screws and bolt to the recommended torque.</p><p>- Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]